{
  "$comment": "Build-time settings of the Market Canopy branding (ADR 0529 decision 2, first layer). Identity values are the ones P02's contract section 2 fixes; scripts/smoke-test checks that the overlay and the patches agree with this file. The update feeds are staging placeholders until P12 publishes the real ones.",
